00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:55,501
你是个不称职的狗妈妈
You're a bad dog owner.

531
00:18:55,600 --> 00:18:56,361
坏狗妈妈
Bad dog owner!

532
00:18:56,760 --> 00:18:57,861
那项圈怎么会在你身上
Why did you have it?

533
00:18:58,114 --> 00:18:58,661
我知道为什么
Well, I know why.

534
00:18:58,980 --> 00:19:00,660
因为他们是一伙的
Yeah, because they're all working together.

535
00:19:01,020 --> 00:19:02,021
又来了
Oh, here we go.

536
00:19:02,040 --> 00:19:03,651
你们该听听他今天早上
You should've heard his paranoia this morning

537
00:19:03,661 --> 00:19:05,460
是怎么对那几个俄罗斯租客疑神疑鬼的
about the -- the Russian renters?

538
00:19:05,600 --> 00:19:07,080
多谢提醒  多谢你提起这事
Oh, I'm glad -- I'm glad you brought up the Russians

539
00:19:07,090 --> 00:19:08,601
看我发现了啥
because look at what I found!

540
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:10,701
那是我的征服者特别雪茄
That's my El Conquistador Especial.

541
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:12,161
今早歌洛莉亚从我这拿的
Gloria took that from me this morning.

542
00:19:12,220 --> 00:19:13,281
我猜
Oh, let me guess,

543
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:15,370
就在她出门买橙汁之前拿的
right before she went out to buy orange juice...

544
00:19:15,380 --> 00:19:16,821
-没错  -其实她并没有买
- That's right. - ...Except for she wasn't.

545
00:19:17,340 --> 00:19:19,510
她和小卡去赶占屋者了
She was with Cam getting rid of the squatters

546
00:19:19,520 --> 00:19:22,180
而我被他拖住了
while I was being stalled by that man!

547
00:19:23,340 --> 00:19:24,701
他们帮我藏麋鹿了
They helped me hide a reindeer!

548
00:19:24,880 --> 00:19:25,941
去年圣诞节的事吗
From a year ago?

549
00:19:26,020 --> 00:19:27,860
鬼知道他们这样已经多久了
Who knows how long this has been going on.

550
00:19:27,900 --> 00:19:29,001
他们私自合伙
Okay, they've been in cahoots,

551
00:19:29,080 --> 00:19:30,530
互相掩护犯下的错事
covering up each other's mistakes

552
00:19:30,540 --> 00:19:32,810
在我们有机会羞辱他们之前就瞒住了
before we've even had a chance to shame them.

553
00:19:32,820 --> 00:19:34,810
你们几个
Since this little alliance

554
00:19:34,820 --> 00:19:36,540
背著我们拉帮结派擅自做决定
made a decision to go behind our backs,

555
00:19:36,560 --> 00:19:38,600
我们也要不带你们  自己做决定一次
maybe we should make a decision without them...

556
00:19:38,610 --> 00:19:40,940
比如度假地点
Oh. ...Like where we're going on vacation.

557
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:42,681
什么  不行  绝对不行
What? No, por favor, no!

558
00:19:42,691 --> 00:19:42,830
什么  不行  怎么可以这样
What? No! You can't do that.

559
00:19:42,840 --> 00:19:44,201
姐喜欢  姐喜欢
I like it. I like it.

560
00:19:44,220 --> 00:19:45,581
就这么定了  去投票吧
Let's do this. Let's go vote.

561
00:19:47,336 --> 00:19:48,634
好  有了
Yep. We've got it.

562
00:19:48,800 --> 00:19:50,221
好了  我们决定了
Okay. We've reached a decision.

563
00:19:50,320 --> 00:19:51,241
鼓声起
Drum roll please.

564
00:19:53,780 --> 00:19:54,501
凑合吧
Close enough.

565
00:19:55,640 --> 00:19:56,821
我们全家要去
The family is going to...

566
00:19:58,880 --> 00:19:59,422
意大利
...Italy!

567
00:19:59,608 --> 00:20:00,584
好棒啊
Ah! Yes!

568
00:20:00,594 --> 00:20:01,956
天呐  太棒了
Oh, my God! That's awesome!

569
00:20:02,120 --> 00:20:03,621
真好啊  大家
That's so awesome, guys!

570
00:20:04,660 --> 00:20:08,440
最可笑的是他们还以为这主意是自己想出来的呢
The cutest part is that they think it was their idea.

571
00:20:15,120 --> 00:20:16,161
在做什么呢
Mmm, what are you making?

572
00:20:16,660 --> 00:20:17,970
是一道杰妈妈
I'm making an Italian dish

573
00:20:17,980 --> 00:20:19,960
以前做过的意大利菜
that Jay's mother used to make.

574
00:20:21,400 --> 00:20:22,541
意大利千层面早餐
Breakfast lasagna.

575
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:24,121
很棒的决定  亲爱的
Great call, honey.

576
00:20:29,825 --> 00:20:31,450
亲爱的  你的早餐在桌上了
Hey, sweetie, your breakfast is on the table.

577
00:20:31,460 --> 00:20:32,381
这是啥
Oh, what's this?

578
00:20:32,700 --> 00:20:34,601
我给意大利帅哥取了名  他叫乔瓦尼
Oh! I've named him. It's Giovanni.

579
00:20:35,540 --> 00:20:37,920
我还在想昨晚的电影
I'm still thinking about that movie last night.

580
00:20:38,160 --> 00:20:39,341
你选得真是好
You picked a good one.

581
00:20:39,420 --> 00:20:42,160
只有意大利人才拍得出这么浪漫的东西
Only the Italians could make something that romantic.

582
00:20:43,036 --> 00:20:44,001
给我的爱人[意语]的煎饼
Flapjacks for mi amore.

583
00:20:44,280 --> 00:20:45,101
谢谢[意语]
Oh, grazie.

584
00:20:49,820 --> 00:20:51,970
爸  无意冒犯  这些杂志里的内容
No offense, dad, but I'm not sure these magazines

585
00:20:51,980 --> 00:20:53,981
没你想的那么有价值
are the treasure trove of information you thought they were.

586
00:20:54,080 --> 00:20:55,221
为什么这么说
What are you talking about?

587
00:20:55,620 --> 00:20:57,261
《冰川:  直到永远》
Glaciers: Now and Forever.

588
00:20:57,640 --> 00:20:59,510
《加拿大:  我们北方的神秘邻国》
Canada: Our mysterious Neighbor to the North.

589
00:20:59,520 --> 00:21:01,920
这些失落部落的照片挺有意思的
Don't hate these photos of the lost tribes.

590
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:03,661
她裙子上吊的是人头
That's a human head hanging off her skirt.

591
00:21:04,300 --> 00:21:05,970
孩子们  这些杂志记录的是
Kids, these magazines harken back to a time

592
00:21:05,980 --> 00:21:07,900
人类为填饱肚子费尽心思的时代
when man had to forage and fight for his foods.

593
00:21:08,140 --> 00:21:09,521
你们现在的日子过得太舒服了
You guys have it too easy nowadays.

594
00:21:09,560 --> 00:21:10,965
可以躺著吃零食  说一句
You can lay around eating snacks saying,

595
00:21:11,067 --> 00:21:12,700
"谷歌  把厨房灯调暗"就行了
"Okay, Google, dim the kitchen lights."

596
00:21:13,100 --> 00:21:13,721
没问题
Sure thing.

597
00:21:15,520 --> 00:21:16,481
继续  爸
Go ahead, Dad.

598
00:21:17,840 --> 00:21:18,741
好吧  谷歌
Okay, Google,

599
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:21,380
给我放一段
show me a video of a kangaroo

600
00:21:22,100 --> 00:21:25,060
袋鼠和海盗打羽毛球的片子
playing badminton with a pirate.

601
00:21:25,180 --> 00:21:26,601
好的  正在在线播放
Sure, playing on YouTube.

602
00:21:27,340 --> 00:21:27,802
太神了吧
What?
